         <h1>The Bauhaus</h1>
         <p>A German art school that ran for the fourteen years, was shut down by politics, and still descides what most of the things around you look like.</p>
         <p>Below is the Dessau buliding, designed by Walter Gropius in 1925. Steel frame, glass curtain wal, and the name set vertically in sans serif down the corner.</p>
